[I] Qt accessibility client library

[T] Helper library to make writing accessibility tools easier. It provides
[T] a Qt API to the AT-SPI accessibility tree of the running applications.

[U] https://invent.kde.org/libraries/libqaccessibilityclient

[A] KDE
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/library
[F] CROSS

[L] LGPL
[V] 0.6.0

